## Conclusion: what happened?

Few possibilities

- BB did not standardize the data (2018, 2019, 2020, 2021)
- Weights provided were not the true weights used
- Methodology is not accurately described
- Provided data is not accurate
- Final score is not linear combination of variables
- What else?

